      ],
      "notes": "Implement in the dedicated pg/private/tool-display-modes worktree. Commit completed validated work, then merge --no-ff into pg/daily only after the full task is complete.\n\n[2026-07-22T15:05:23.721Z] Manager accepted after focused renderer/settings tests, npm run check, coding-agent build, and an interactive pseudo-TTY smoke showing read(path=\"package.json\", offset=1, limit=5) with inline success summary.",
      "description": "Implement the approved Pi core TUI design for transparent tool calls and low-density tool results. Add independent call minimal/full and result minimal/compact/full modes, default both to minimal, preserve exact model-supplied argument names, retain legacy renderer compatibility, update configurable settings/keybindings/docs, and validate with focused tests plus npm run check.",
